  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAuditor’s Office - Winnebago County Government - Iowa\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n Bid Notices\n Calendar\n\n Courts\n\n Elections\n Employment\n FAQ\n \n\n Translate Language\n \n Translate\n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n Home\n \n\n About \n \n\n Boards & Commissions\n Cemeteries\n Communities\n Elected Officials\n School Districts\n Township Information\n \n \n \n\n Departments \n \n\n 911 Communications\n Assessor\n Attorney\n Auditor\n Conservation\n Economic Development\n Emergency Management\n General Assistance/Relief\n Public Health\n Recorder\n Road Department\n Sheriff & Jail\n Social Services\n Treasurer\n Veterans Affairs\n Zoning\n \n \n \n\n Board of Supervisors \n \n\n Boards & Commissions\n County Ordinances\n Meetings & Minutes\n \n \n Contact\n \n\n Bid Notices\n Calendar\n Courts\n Elections\n Employment\n FAQ\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n \n Clear · 48°\n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \nDepartments\n \n\nAuditor \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n Courthouse\n \n126 S. Clark St.\n\n Forest City, IA 50436 \nDriving Directions\n \n Contact Information\n \n641-585-3412 \n641-585-9302 (Fax) \n Hours\n \nMonday - Friday\n \n8:00 a.m. - 4:30 p.m.\n Holiday Closures Our Team\n \n\n \n Karla Weiss\n\n Auditor\n\n \n\n Kris Oswald\n\n Deputy/Drainage Clerk\n\n \n\n Chelsey Ostrander\n\n Auditor Clerk\n\n \n\n Lori Jacobs\n\n Election Clerk\n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n \n \n About the Auditor\n \n \n\n \n \n Accounts\nPayable\n \n \n\n \n \n Drainage\nDistricts\n \n \n\n \n \n Elections & Voting\n \n \n\n \n \n Licenses & Permits\n \n \n\n \n \n Financial & Tax Information\n \n \n\n \n \n FAQ\n \n \n\n \nAuditor\n \nThe County Auditor's primary functions are: \n \n \n \nFinancial and Accounting Records: Prepares County budget and monthly and annual financial reports of the County. Administers payroll and benefits for all county employees. Prepares claims and issues checks for payment of invoices, and maintain records of all county financial reports. \n \nReal Estate: Maintains official County property transfer and plat books. \n \nElections & Voter Registration: Conducts all elections for county, cities, schools, special districts & the State of Iowa. Registers and maintains voter records. \n \nProperty Taxation: Prepares the annual report of assessed and taxable valuations of property in the county for use by all local governmental entities in the preparation of their budgets. Reviews and certifies budgets of all local governments in the county. Computes and certifies tax levies for taxing districts. Prepares tax lists for collection by the Treasurer. \n \nClerk to the Board of Supervisors: Prepares meeting agendas, prepares and maintains minutes of Board proceedings, and maintains Board records. \n \nCustodian of the Courthouse: Oversight of the care and maintenance of the courthouse subject to the direction of the Board of Supervisors. \n \nMaintains files for Liquor & Cigarette Licenses as approved by the Board. \n \n \n\nLearn more about the Auditor \n \n\n \nMap & Directions\n \n\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n County Courthouse\n\n 126 S Clark St.\n\n Forest City, IA 50436\n\n Contact Us\n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n Hours & Holidays\n\n Department Hours\n\n Upcoming Holidays\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n©2026 Winnebago County, Iowa · Title VI & ADA Information\n \npowered by \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \nUpcoming Holiday Closure Schedule\n \n \nVeterans Day (November 11, 2026)\n \nThanksgiving Day (November 26, 2026)\n \nDay after Thanksgiving (November 27, 2026)\n \nChristmas Eve (December 24, 2026)\n \nChristmas Day (December 25, 2026)\n \nNew Year’s Day (January 1, 2027)\n \n\n\n\n\n\n"
